1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Hello, can I help you?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,580
I was told to come here

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:06,960
because I'd like to talk to someone about taking a management course.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:10,430
Right. I'm one of the tutors, so I should be able to help you.

5
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:13,180
Oh, good. My name's Brian Ardley

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,842
I've decided to enroll on a part- time management course.

7
00:00:15,842 --> 00:00:20,240
A friend of mine took one last year, and recommended it to me.

8
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:20,910
Right.

9
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:25,200
Is there anything I should do before the course, like reading or anything?

10
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,660
We prefer to integrate reading with the course

11
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:30,949
so we don't give out a reading list in advance.

12
00:00:30,949 --> 00:00:35,420
But we like people to write a case study, describing an organization they know.

13
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:38,524
I've already done that, my friends told me you wanted one.

14
00:00:38,524 --> 00:00:43,321
But would it be possible to sit in on a teaching session, to see what it's like?

15
00:00:43,321 --> 00:00:45,860
I haven't been a student for quite a while.

16
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:49,880
Fine. Just let me know which date, and I'll arrange it with the tutor.

17
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:53,290
Now, could I ask you about the college facilities, please?

18
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:54,890
Anything in particular?

19
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:58,580
Well, the course is one day a week, all day, isn't it

20
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:01,600
So presumably it's possible to buy food?

21
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,670
Yes, the refectory's open all day.

22
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:07,600
Does it cater for special diets? I have some food allergies.

23
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:10,800
Provided you warn the refectory in advance, it won't be a problem.

24
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:14,040
Good. What about facilities for young children

25
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,000
I'd like to bring my daughter here while I'm studying.

26
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,020
How old is she?

27
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:18,560
Three.

28
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:21,260
Then she's eligible to join the nursery

29
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:23,263
which is supervised by a qualified Nursery Nurse.

30
00:01:23,263 --> 00:01:28,280
The waiting list for a place is quite long though, so you ought to apply now.

31
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:28,800
OK.

32
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:32,490
I don't know if our careers advice service would be of any interest to you?

33
00:01:32,490 --> 00:01:37,150
Yes, it might help me decide how to develop my career after the course.

34
00:01:37,150 --> 00:01:39,500
The centre has a lot of reference materials

35
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:43,110
and staff qualified to give guidance on a one-to-one basis.

36
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:47,500
I noticed a fitness centre next to the college. Is that for students?

37
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:52,290
It's open to everyone, but students pay an annual fee that's much less than the general public pay.

38
00:01:52,290 --> 00:01:57,930
And presumably the college library stocks newspapers and journals, as well as books?

39
00:01:57,930 --> 00:02:00,620
Yes, and there's also an audio-visual room

40
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:03,900
for viewing and listening to videos, cassettes, and so on.

41
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:06,390
Is there also access to computers?

42
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:10,968
Yes, your tutor will need to arrange with the technical support team for you to get a password,

43
00:02:10,968 --> 00:02:14,020
so ask him or her about it when you start the course.

44
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:14,530
OK.

45
00:02:14,530 --> 00:02:18,100
By the way, do you know about our Business Centre?

46
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,720
No. What's that?

47
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:24,277
It's a training resource-a collection of materials for people to study on their own,

48
00:02:24,277 --> 00:02:26,230
or use in their own organizations.

49
00:02:26,230 --> 00:02:28,650
Uhuh. You mean books and videos?

50
00:02:28,650 --> 00:02:30,820
Yes, and manuals for self-study.

51
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,724
Plus a lot of computer-based materials,

52
00:02:32,724 --> 00:02:35,920
so people can work through them at their own speed

53
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,120
and repeat anything they aren't sure about.

54
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:45,230
And you can hire laptops to use in your own home or workplace as well as printers that you can take away.

55
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:49,386
Does it have anything that I could use to improve my study skills?

56
00:02:49,386 --> 00:02:52,200
I don't have much idea about report writing

57
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,820
and I'm sure I'll need it on the course.

58
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:58,800
Oh yes, there's plenty of useful material. Just ask one of the staff.

59
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:02,020
Does the centre cover all the main areas of business?

60
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:05,818
Yes, topics like finance, and of course marketing. That's a popular one.

61
00:03:05,818 --> 00:03:09,270
Local managers seem to queue up to borrow the videos!

62
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:11,350
So it isn't just for students, then?

63
00:03:11,350 --> 00:03:15,320
No, it's for members only, but anyone can join.

64
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,470
How much does it cost?

65
00:03:16,470 --> 00:03:21,040
£100 a year for a company, and £50 for an individual

66
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:23,280
with no discount for students, I'm afraid.

67
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,781
That's very helpful. Well, I think that's all.

68
00:03:25,781 --> 00:03:30,470
I'd better go home and fill in the enrolment form. Thanks for all your help.

69
00:03:30,470 --> 00:03:31,900
You're welcome. Goodbye.

70
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:32,100
Goodbye.
